SCP idea- Leviathan of The midnight Sun (Mitternachtsonne) [Seeking Greenlight]


20 Nov 2020 01:35






Seeking Greenlights:  Yes

Page Type:  SCP Article

Elevator Pitch:  SCP-XXXX is a large, dark, 45m quadrupedal aquatic lifeform located somewhere in the Atlantic at a site known as The Ring. SCP-XXXX has some resemblance to the prehistoric lizard Mosasaurs, the exceptions being that it has a tentacle like mane around the back of its cranium, as well being exceedingly fast, exceptionally strong, covered in a robust black scale armour exterior. The SCP also has 7 pupils in each eye. SCP can only viewed at night at designated platforms 350m below sea level. Videoing or photographing SCP-XXXX must be avoided as well as viewing it for more than 1 minute continuously, or making direct eye contact. SCP-XXXX origins remain unknown, during the 3 failed expeditions SCP-XXXX was continuously on the move and ever increasing its area of influence.

Central Narrative:  SCP-XXXX was first alerted to the SCP foundation through a field agent located inside of NOAA(National oceanic and atmospheric administration). NOAA identified a drastic change in salinity in an area roughly 1km2 somewhere in the Atlantic. The foundation sent an initial expedition with hopes of discovering what the cause of this disturbance was. The expedition resulted in the loss of all life, but not all was lost, data emitted to command from the expedition revealed that the salinity in the water had changed and that the underwater local flora/fauna were mutated and aggressive. Beside this it was also discovered that the SCP causing this was aggressive and intelligent.

After a considerable loss of life and 3 more expeditions were the foundation able to secure SCP at a site known as the ring with new pieces of technology, such as the PUVDS ( perimeter ultra violet defence system- a defence systems which emits a strong ultra violet light deep into the water), SPS( Sea perimeter system- a system designed to prevent the influence of SCP-XXXX from exceeding a 20km2 zone and for the salinity of water to not change outside of the zone. Loss of life was deemed acceptable to contain SCP-XXXX given its aggressiveness and intelligence and usual parameters of containment failing.

Hook/Attention-Grabber:  SCP-XXXX is capable Phycological Physical Mutation (Able to transform a victim using their brain to mutate the body, without the need of physical contact provided certain conditions are met) creating a sub entity of various forms like the Gespenst( wraith). SCP most dangerous ability is that it is capable of salinity conversion, which if left uncheck can cause cataclysmic change in weather, flora/fauna, disrupt oxygen levels.

Additional Notes: Constructive criticism is greatly appreciated.👍





